  "text": "On the microphone is Nicholas Grundle. This is a test track. Tell me if you can hear me. Say yes three times. On the desktop track is a song I am going to play now. Okay, a little bit later. Now I am going to play a famous speech. See if you can hear it on the desktop. I have the pleasure to present to you Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. I am happy to join with you today in what will go down in history as the greatest demonstration for freedom in the history of our nation. Five score years ago, a great American in whose symbolic shadow we stand today, signed the Emancipation Proclamation. Okay, with that we conclude our thing. Although I do want to do an overlapping section where we see if we can get the time stamps overlapping where I am also talking at the same time that the speech is going on."
